AWS S3 Static Website Hosting

A simple static website hosted using Amazon S3 as part of my AWS learning journey.

In this project, I used both the AWS Management Console and AWS CLI to create and configure an S3 bucket, manage permissions, and upload website files. Working with both approaches helped me understand AWS from both a GUI-based and command-line perspective.

☁️ AWS Services & Tools
Amazon S3
AWS Management Console
AWS CLI
HTML
CSS

🚀 What I Learned
Creating and configuring an S3 bucket
Uploading website files to Amazon S3
Configuring permissions for static website hosting
Hosting a static website using S3
Managing AWS resources through the AWS Management Console
Using AWS CLI commands to automate S3 operations
